sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Gateway
    participant 2FA as TwoFactorService
    participant Repo
    
    User->>Gateway: Verify Code
    Gateway->>2FA: verify(userId, code)
    2FA->>Repo: getSecret(userId)
    Repo-->>2FA: secret
    2FA->>2FA: validateCode(secret, code)
    alt Valid
        2FA->>Repo: updateStatus(VERIFIED)
        2FA-->>Gateway: success
    else Invalid
        2FA->>Repo: incrementAttempts()
        2FA-->>Gateway: fail
    end
